  - surface exposure note: vectorfl applies mark, user reads next-work signal, engine reads validation/extraction material
  - what must not be flattened: do not reduce mark to done state, approval, promotion, or final status
  - next reread question: Which marks are being mistaken for completed work?
  - suggested next use: validation target

